# Files in the build output that must not be uploaded as public assets.
# Same syntax as .gitignore; Cloudflare reads this from the assets directory.
# (Wrangler already excludes _headers, _redirects and this file itself.)

# Source maps. Vite is configured with sourcemap: 'hidden' so nothing references
# them, but without this they would still be uploaded and publicly fetchable —
# which is how the full annotated sources were being served.
*.map
